{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Calm the storm within.</strong> Inspired by mindfulness techniques, this unique puzzle game helps you visualize and manage anxious thoughts. Instead of being overwhelmed, you'll focus on a single thought, bring it into your mental space, and simply Maze It Out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Focus your mind:</strong>\u00a0Build intricate mazes using various blockers to prevent the Dark Whispers from reaching your heart.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore over 100 puzzles:</strong> Journey through a smooth difficulty curve, starting with a relaxing campaign and progressing to challenging trials for puzzle veterans.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unleash your creativity:</strong> Share your own maze designs using the sandbox map editor!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hand-drawn visual:</strong> That we hope you will find charming ^^.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3899320?t=1757708322","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3899320/e6386066a692918780f1102cd8bdaf1fd6f0aa8d/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1757708322","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3899320/3b1edc99919f16b62b957dc4a623e963acc7b068/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757708322","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3899320/3b1edc99919f16b62b957dc4a623e963acc7b068/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757708322","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Calm the storm within.</strong> Inspired by mindfulness techniques, this unique puzzle game helps you visuali